flowchart TD
  CLAIM[Java claim job + authorize snapshot] --> CLASSIFY[AgentScope classify / extract]
  CLASSIFY --> EVIDENCE[Scoped tools collect evidence]
  EVIDENCE --> READY{Java readiness PASS?}
  READY -->|No| WAIT[Persist gaps / wake condition; end attempt]
  WAIT -->|New evidence / approved input| CLAIM
  READY -->|Yes| DRAFT[AgentScope draft from bound facts]
  DRAFT --> VALIDATE[Java checks + optional semantic validator]
  VALIDATE -->|Blocked| REVIEW[Persist NEEDS_REVIEW]
  VALIDATE -->|Accepted| HUMAN[Versioned draft / human review]
  HUMAN --> OUTLOOK[Create Outlook draft; AM sends]
  HUMAN -->|Separately enabled| SEND[Exact approval; Java action executor]
  OUTLOOK --> RECEIPT[Observe and reconcile result]
  SEND --> RECEIPT
  RECEIPT --> CASE[Update action status; close only on business evidence]
